== Description ==
'''Tpose''' is an [[Emotes|emote]] that can be bought in the store for {{Coins|750}}. It was made by [https://www.roblox.com/users/16983447/profile BelowNatural]. The emote is looped and no music can be heard while performing the emote. You can also move while performing this emote, albeit slower than usual.

== Trivia ==
*This [[Emotes|emote]] and its inventory description are both based on the [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/t-pose T-Pose meme], which became popular starting from the early 2010s.
*This was one of the first emotes to be added to the game.

